IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pcla-rules`

§ `Tests`

#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the High Court`, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `another federal court`, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `the Supreme Court of a Territory`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act bars it`
-- Changed after the independent pass: a decision of another court is not
-- barred by this Act.
#ASSERT `may I ask for leave from` (`Decision` OF `another court`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `this Act does not bar it`
